# Flutter/Dart
**/.dart_tool/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/build/
**/ios/Pods/
**/ios/.symlinks/
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/local.properties

# Lockfiles: committed for anything that is run rather than depended on, so
# a clone builds and imports with the same versions it was tested against.
**/pubspec.lock
!app/pubspec.lock
!tool/pubspec.lock

# Env / secrets. The bare rule matches at any depth, so app/.env and tool/.env
# are both covered.
.env
.env.local

# Tooling
.claude/

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
